    <title>Overnight Returns and Retail Order Flow</title>
    <summary>We show that stocks with high past overnight returns relative to intraday
returns subsequently underperform. A long-short portfolio sorted on the overnight
minus intraday return spread earns an annualised Sharpe ratio of 0.8 between 2000
and 2025.</summary>
